# Never into an image: secrets, local environments, build output and data dumps.
# H01: the compose builds had no ignore file, so a context could carry any of these.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.dump
**/*.dump.gpg
**/*.bak
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
backups/
docs/market-research/
docs/reports/pdf/
docs/reports/html/
**/.terraform
